  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Aura</strong> faint Alteration; <strong>CL</strong> 2nd<br>\n<strong>Slot</strong> none; <strong>Price</strong> 100 gp; <strong>Weight</strong> 0.1 lbs.</p>\n<p><strong>Description</strong><br>\nThe drinker of this potion increase their size category by 1 step (maximum Large) for 2 minutes. This is a polymorph effect.</p>\n<p><strong>Construction Requirements</strong><br>\nDistill Compound, Alteration sphere (Size Change); <strong>Cost</strong> 50 gp</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/compounds#toc111\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": "<p>Reviewed selection: 100 gp.</p><p>Source one-step cap remains authoritative. Do not import Vanara's fixed Small form or generic Enlarge Person restrictions wholesale. Temporary size/form resolution is manual.</p><p>Single-dose quantity is consumed through the native helper. Target outcomes, temporary effects and any external eligibility remain deliberate; carrying the bottle grants no persistent bonus.</p>",
